<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - Valorant Protocol</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">VALORANT PROTOCOL</a>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="details.html">Details</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="about.html">About</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="new-character-form.html">Add a Character</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-5">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?w=600" class="img-fluid rounded shadow border border-danger" alt="Valorant Theme">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-7 text-light">
                <h1 class="fw-bold" style="color: #ff4655;">About This Project</h1>
                <p class="lead text-white">Welcome to the Valorant Protocol Character Gallery!</p>
                
                <h4 class="mt-4 text-white">Why Valorant?</h4>
                <p>Valorant is a tactical hero shooter with rich character lore and distinct playstyles. I chose this theme because each agent brings unique tactical capabilities and high visual appeal to design around.</p>

                <h4 class="mt-4 text-white">Design Choices</h4>
                <p>The visual style takes direct inspiration from Riot Games' signature Valorant design aesthetic: dark obsidian backgrounds (`#0f1923`), high-contrast red accents (`#ff4655`), sharp typography, and clean layout cards for effortless browsing.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>